Add and customise the Flipdish Ordering System.



== Description ==



The Flipdish WordPress plugin allows restaurants who use the WordPress platform to add the Flipdish online ordering system to their website using a nice and easy to use interface.



Customise your ordering system to a dark or light theme or remove the background colours entierly using the easy to use interface. Visit our website [https://flipdish.com/](https://flipdish.com/) for further information or visit [https://portal.flipdish.com/](https://portal.flipdish.com/) to set up your account and start accepting orders.



Check out our [help desk](https://help.flipdish.com/en/) to learn more about our platform and additional integrations to take your business to the next level. You can also talk to our [sales team](https://www.flipdish.com/sign-up/online-ordering-system-demo/) to learn more about what we can offer and get you setup.



= Localization =

* English (default) - always included

* .pot file (`flipdish_ordering.pot`) for translators is also always included :)

* *Your translation? - [Just send it in](https://www.flipdish.com/contact/)*



== Translations ==

* English - default, always included



== Frequently Asked Questions ==



= Where can I get my AppID? =



You can learn how to get your AppID [here](https://help.flipdish.com/en/articles/4175488-how-to-find-your-appid) on our helpdesk.



= How can I sign up to Flipdish? =



Please visit our portal at [https://portal.flipdish.com/](https://portal.flipdish.com/) to sign up to Flipdish or [talk to our sales team](https://www.flipdish.com/sign-up/online-ordering-system-demo/).



= What is the "Space above Basket" setting? =



The space above the basket is how far down the page the basket should be from the top of the users screen. This is required for websites that have a sticky header/navigation.



When you visit your menu page with the list of items and you scroll down, the header/navigation sometimes moves down with the page. This will overlap with the ordering basket. If this is happening, please increase the number until the basket is no longer overlapping. If you experience no overlapping at all, please leave it at 0.



= How do I add the ordering system to a page? =



Once you have entered all the information required and clicked 'Save Changes', please click on 'Copy Shortcode'.



Then, go to the page you wish to add the ordering system to and paste it in the text editor field. In Gutemberg you may have to select the `Shortcode` block. In other WordPress editors you may also have to select the `Shortcode` element.



= Do you support table ordering? =



Yes we do. If you need any assistance you can contact our Customer Support team at [https://flipdish.com/](https://flipdish.com/) who are available 24/7.



= I have problems, who do I contact? =



You can visit our help section to see if you can find your answer there [https://help.flipdish.com/](https://help.flipdish.com/). Otherwise you can contact our Customer Support team at [https://flipdish.com/](https://flipdish.com/) who are available 24/7.



